      "Synthetic files cover ingest limits, bounded retry, station configuration, and English/Japanese operator guides.",
      "Tool declarations include single, nested, enum, optional, multiple-call, code, instruction, and no-tool automatic-selection shapes.",
      "Generated Python is untrusted and remains blocked until AQ5 proves the declared sandbox.",
      "Heldout model-output detail remains sealed from mechanism selection until candidate behavior is frozen."
    ],
